@startuml ARCH-08
!include ../theme.puml
title ARCH-08 — Sơ đồ triển khai logic (chưa xác minh production)
node "Client device" {
  artifact "Browser\nHTML/CSS/JS" as Browser
}
node "Java runtime" {
  artifact "PhotoConnect WAR\nSpring Boot 3.3.0" as App
  artifact "JSP compiler / SiteMesh" as JSP
}
database "Microsoft SQL Server" as DB
cloud "Cloudinary SaaS" as Cloudinary
cloud "Google OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect" as OAuth
cloud "SMTP server" as SMTP
Browser --> App : HTTPS / WebSocket
App --> JSP
App --> DB : JDBC + JPA + Flyway
App --> Cloudinary : HTTPS API
App --> OAuth : HTTPS OAuth2/OIDC
App --> SMTP : SMTP/TLS
note right of App
  Mô hình suy ra từ pom.xml và cấu hình.
  Host, proxy, TLS termination và secrets
  production chưa được xác minh.
end note
@enduml
